          <problem>
            <para>Determine if the following sequences are arithmetic or geometric.
          <para>3, 6, 12, 24</para>
         </para>
          </problem>
          <solution>
            <para>Correct! Geometric</para>
            <para>Nice try! The correct answer is Geometric.</para>
          </solution>
        </exercise>
